  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Beautifully presented this 1970's solid concrete and tile apartment in the prime Kohimarama Beach location will capture your heart, without hurting your wallet!\r\nIn a block of four, this upstairs 148sqm two bedroom apartment captures the morning and afternoon sun throughout the light, bright and stylishly proportioned rooms.\r\nIt also boasts a delightfully private courtyard and bonus conservatory space perfect for entertaining and relaxing. It is completed with a single lockup garage, separate laundry and extra storage under the stairs.\r\n\r\nThis is a fabulous central location just 100 metres (approx) from Kohimarama Beach, the cafes and restaurants, Tamaki Drive Transport and a gentle walk around to Mission Bay or Saint Heliers.\r\n\r\nThe perfect lock up and leave or investment for the future.\r\n\r\nThis is a leasehold, crosslease title with an annual ground rental of $40,000 pa.\r\nLocation is everything.\r\n\r\n\"It is in the shelter of each other, that people live.\"",
